    "assumptions": [
      "Clock domain is single at 100 MHz.",
      "Reset is active-low, synchronous.",
      "Input and output streams use ready/valid handshake.",
      "Accumulation saturates at 8-bit maximum? Not specified, assumed modulo-256."
